Rebuild relationship profiles for many contacts at once

Usage: mxr relationships <COMMAND>

Commands:
  rebuild  Rebuild the profile and summary of every contact with mail in the last --since days, backfilled mail included
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
